{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Renovate a space and transform it into a functional pawn shop! Save money for the renovation, or don't renovate at all! Gain skills that you can use later to make smart buying and selling decisions, boosting your profits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149100/extras/HighresScreenshot00000.png?t=1742085418\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Transform |</strong>\u00a0Renovate your pawn shop by building your workspace from scratch. Paint the walls, floors and create the space for a successful business.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149100/extras/02.png?t=1742085418\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Negotation |</strong> After assessing the item's value, propose a price for the product. SScan the product, set a fair value, and negotiate without going below 45% of the average price.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149100/extras/Zrzut_ekranu_2025-03-15_220634.png?t=1742085418\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Organize\u00a0|</strong> Set up your pawn shop by creating spots for shelves to display your goods. Customize the layout to fit your trading needs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149100/extras/03.png?t=1742085418\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3149100?t=1742085418","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3149100?t=174208541